1
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,319
So, regarding the theme of this exam, "you",

2
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,079
it's not just about lines and acting.

3
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,759
It requires chemistry built

4
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,839
on deep understanding and trust.

5
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:21,840
So next, we're going to have

6
00:00:21,841 --> 00:00:24,399
a real-life survival chase battle.

7
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,960
You'll face the following challenges.

8
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,119
There are five teams here,

9
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,799
each representing a color.

10
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,879
In the first-floor atrium, there are balloons in five colors.

11
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,639
The balloons cannot leave the first-floor atrium.

12
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:37,159
When you pop the balloon of your team's color,

13
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,120
then your team,

14
00:00:38,121 --> 00:00:40,239
unlocks three minutes of Free Hunt.

15
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:40,960
During the hunt,

16
00:00:40,961 --> 00:00:42,039
if you tag someone's torso,

17
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,639
you can take their wristband.

18
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,120
After being tagged,

19
00:00:44,121 --> 00:00:46,279
they get a thirty-second cooldown time to run away.

20
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,559
Everyone wears three wristbands

21
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,519
in their team's color on the left hand.

22
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,719
Wear the wristbands you got from the pursuit on your right wrist.

23
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,599
When your left-hand wristbands run out,

24
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,440
you're out.

25
00:00:55,441 --> 00:00:58,560
Collect wristbands of all four other colors to win.

26
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:06,119
And the winner's prize

27
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,359
is that your suitcase

28
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,800
will be returned to you.

29
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,680
I really want that.

30
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,640
I really, really want that.

31
00:01:12,641 --> 00:01:14,760
This is a fight worth having.

32
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:17,599
This one's really hard to get.

33
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,560
So little time.

34
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,360
No face towel.

35
00:01:19,361 --> 00:01:20,599
Got a face towel.

36
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,639
So embarrassing.

37
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,640
It keeps falling.

38
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,200
That's all there is.

39
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,840
Keep it safe for now.

40
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,919
Next, we'll take you

41
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,599
to various spots around the building.

42
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,279
Gu Jiacheng will pop the first balloon

43
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,280
in the lobby to start the game.

44
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:34,560
Go.

45
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,080
Come on.

46
00:01:35,081 --> 00:01:36,840
Go.

47
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,279
I think we should stay here first,

48
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:47,559
and then I'll open the door halfway later.

49
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,480
If I hear a sound or

50
00:01:48,481 --> 00:01:50,320
I hear footsteps, I can run,

51
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:54,199
maybe I'll just stay upstairs.

52
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,599
He goes down to pump the balloon,

53
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,719
or I start pumping first.

54
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,079
Then one person goes hunting,

55
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,639
and the other tries to find a chance.

56
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:03,479
Or how about I'm the one pumping the balloon?

57
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,999
Because honestly, I don't have much stamina.

58
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,039
Your stamina isn't great, is it?

59
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,400
Okay, then I'll do the running.

60
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:12,279
And I think another good thing about this spot

61
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,759
is that the echo over here is really loud.

62
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,400
If...

63
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,480
See you.

64
00:02:20,481 --> 00:02:22,160
Is it really that easy to find?

65
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,599
How about we go over there?

66
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,399
That spot isn't easy to spot.

67
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,599
Why don't we just lie down here?

68
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:29,520
Underneath.

69
00:02:29,521 --> 00:02:30,559
Okay.

70
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,199
The two of us can hide under that table

71
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,519
like two snails.

72
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,679
We're definitely winning today.

73
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,479
Today, our only strategy is to hide,

74
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,480
hide till the very end.

75
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:39,559
Our strategy now is for me

76
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,079
to stall Mr. Gu first.

77
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,919
Then let my other teammate

78
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,399
hurry downstairs and pump the balloon.

79
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,400
Let's switch quickly.

80
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,039
Honestly, I don't know what he's up to.

81
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:49,999
He might go team up with Senior,

82
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,440
then we can take everyone else out.

83
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,999
I can't figure out what his strategy is.

84
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,119
For some reason, Wang Ruijian and I

85
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,639
have zero chemistry.

86
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,879
We originally wanted to hide.

87
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:01,360
Lay low.

88
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,200
But I told him,

89
00:03:02,201 --> 00:03:03,359
“Forget it. Let's not hide anymore.”

90
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,320
That's too cowardly.

91
00:03:04,321 --> 00:03:05,799
Chen Zhixuan is nowhere to be found.

92
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,559
We were on mics,

93
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,880
but we didn't work well together.

94
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:10,959
Countdown.

95
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:13,720
Three, two, one.

96
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:17,159
Game starts.

97
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:20,200
It's now the Orange Team's Hunt Time.

98
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,919
Because I'm on my own.

99
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:23,999
I have to defend,

100
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,239
and attack at the same time.

101
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,719
Whoever gets close to me,

102
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,800
that's who I'll catch.

103
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:45,240
Take the elevator down to the third floor.

104
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,359
He keeps circling that room.

105
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,680
There's no way to get over there.

106
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,320
Nothing at all.

107
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:23,000
Hurry downstairs.

108
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,559
Go.

109
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,560
Back to the third floor to pop the balloons.

110
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,160
Pop the balloons directly?

111
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,160
Yes.

112
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:52,960
Oh no.

113
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,840
Come back.

114
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:56,160
He's going downstairs.

115
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,160
It's fine.

116
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,080
He's coming.

117
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,600
Go.

118
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,279
I saw Senior go downstairs,

119
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:09,959
so Ziyu and I split up and ran.

120
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:11,239
We wanted to avoid Senior,

121
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,440
and pop the balloons.

122
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,079
As soon as I got downstairs,

123
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,199
I saw Ziyu was closest to me.

124
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,999
I originally wanted to catch Ziyu.

125
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,439
But when I turned around, Sun Mingyang was holding a big balloon,

126
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,679
right on the other side.

127
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:25,199
I was afraid he'd pop the balloon right away,

128
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,359
run back up and counter-kill me.

129
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,520
So I had to stop him.

130
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,920
The balloon can't be taken out.

131
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,399
Here, take this.

132
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:37,200
Okay.

133
00:05:37,201 --> 00:05:39,400
Orange Team gets a pink wristband.

134
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:41,920
We're done for.

135
00:05:41,921 --> 00:05:42,959
Sun Mingyang got caught.

136
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,920
Our team doesn't have a single wristband left.

137
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,960
Orange Team's Hunt Time has thirty seconds left.

138
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,840
Senior was really close to me at the time,

139
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,400
and I never expected he locked onto me at first glance.

140
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,439
I thought maybe I could pull off a dodge-and-run,

141
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,720
so I tried to circle around him.

142
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:06,319
But Senior was just too fast.

143
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:08,359
It's pink again.

144
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,759
Orange Team gets its second pink wristband.

145
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:12,600
Orange Team has ten seconds of game time left.

146
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,680
Go.

147
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,920
Go pump the balloon.

148
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,280
Orange Team's Hunt Time is over.

149
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:36,839
I couldn't reach Chen Zhixuan at the time,

150
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:37,560
so there was no other way.

151
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,480
Since I couldn't reach him,

152
00:06:38,481 --> 00:06:40,239
I had to rely on myself

153
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,359
to see if there was any chance

154
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,719
to get the balloon inflated.

155
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,999
Buy some time

156
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,680
for Chen Zhixuan and me.

157
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:50,120
Hurry.

158
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,199
That's not my pump.

159
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,480
Pump it fast.

160
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,840
He ran.

161
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,039
This doesn't feel good.

162
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,360
I'm out of here.

163
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:11,800
Now it's the Green Team's Hunt Time.

164
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,680
He can see both of us.

165
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:33,119
It popped again.

166
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:35,600
Now it's the Green Team's Hunt Time.

167
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,839
Now it's the Green Team's Hunt Time.

168
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:43,119
At the time, we knew that

169
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,199
popping the balloon made us the hunters.

170
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:47,239
So we went after that goal

171
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,999
and popped them one after another.

172
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,240
We could stay hunters forever.

173
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,400
They found a bug.

174
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,919
They could extend their time endlessly.

175
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,560
I figured it out.

176
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,560
Yep.

177
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,560
Green Team.

178
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,320
Go.

179
00:08:30,321 --> 00:08:32,399
Green Team.

180
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,400
Quick.

181
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,159
I looked at the classroom on the right,

182
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,439
and a blue figure flashed in.

183
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,959
I couldn't run anymore by then,

184
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:42,000
so I just went into the classroom to take a chance.

185
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,439
Don't go.

186
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,880
You've got one of my colors already.

187
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,440
Didn't expect him to spot me

188
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,320
the moment he walked in.

189
00:08:50,321 --> 00:08:51,479
He caught me again.

190
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,879
My second life.

191
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,199
The third time.

192
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,759
I was still wandering around that floor,

193
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,440
trying to find Wang Ruijian,

194
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,839
and then the thirty seconds were up.

195
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:02,040
Bai caught me one more time.

196
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,559
What's the point of taking me out?

197
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:08,079
You win with wristbands of four colors.

198
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,359
Even if he got all my wristbands,

199
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:10,240
it means nothing to him.

200
00:09:10,241 --> 00:09:12,479
I realized I'm someone who doesn't understand the game rules.

201
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,000
You know?

202
00:09:13,001 --> 00:09:16,000
I mistakenly thought the more wristbands you had,

203
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,720
the better your chances of winning.

204
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,039
I caught one after another,

205
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,839
my arm got tired from swinging,

206
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,360
and it turned out to be useless.

207
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,280
How about this.

208
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,199
Let's swap.

209
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,399
I can't go on. I'm too tired.

210
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,880
What's the point of making me out?

211
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,440
Let's swap.

212
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:43,760
We're going upstairs.

213
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,759
Green Team, thirty seconds left in Hunt Time.

214
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:48,960
Go down three floors. We have to grab the balloons now.

215
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,480
Go.

216
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,640
How about later.

217
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:02,640
How about later.

218
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,480
Wait a second.

219
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,559
Wait a second.

220
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:19,680
Let me catch my breath.

221
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,800
Green Team's Hunt Time is over.

222
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:27,479
During the chase,

223
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,400
my mic accidentally fell off and slid away.

224
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,680
And after that,

225
00:10:30,681 --> 00:10:32,481
I never got in touch with Chen Zhixuan again.

226
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:42,080
Okay, now it's the Pink Team's Hunt Time.

227
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,400
They switched players.

228
00:10:44,401 --> 00:10:45,999
The chase is on.

229
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,679
Pink Team.

230
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:48,680
Who's on the Pink Team?

231
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,280
He runs so fast.

232
00:10:50,281 --> 00:10:51,759
I can't take it.

233
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,080
Who's on the Pink Team?

234
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:57,279
We plan to let them fight each other

235
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:59,039
while we reap the benefits.

236
00:10:59,040 --> 00:10:59,640
"Kill" him.

237
00:10:59,641 --> 00:11:00,760
He's got a "knife".

238
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,239
Only one thing on my mind.

239
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,319
I have to catch him.

240
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,640
I can't let down my teammates for the time they bought us.

241
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,000
After I caught him,

242
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,080
turns out he's this tall.

243
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,359
I can't believe I'm still alive.

244
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,039
He's got some nerve too.

245
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:27,480
Zhang Ziyu, you're awesome.

246
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:29,000
Are you tired? I can run a bit.

247
00:11:29,001 --> 00:11:30,280
It's fine.

248
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:34,240
We've got it easy here.

249
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:37,240
Let's rest a bit.

250
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,999
Now it's the Blue Team's Hunt Time.

251
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,479
Now it's the Orange Team's Hunt Time.

252
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,959
Now it's the Pink Team's Hunt Time.

253
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,720
Hurry up.

254
00:11:48,721 --> 00:11:49,959
We're the wolves.

255
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,000
Got him.

256
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:03,080
Ten minutes left in the game.

257
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,959
I think it's about time.

258
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,360
Let's go.

259
00:12:06,361 --> 00:12:07,520
Let's go out for a walk.

260
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:09,880
Let's go pop some balloons.

261
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:11,959
Get out quick.

262
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:12,960
Run!

263
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:29,880
Oh no,

264
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:32,680
the air pump is gone.

265
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,119
I'll do it.

266
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,559
Use it freely.

267
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,040
You pump too.

268
00:12:37,041 --> 00:12:38,400
The air pump is gone.

269
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,000
Oh no.

270
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,360
Blow it up.

271
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,360
Take it and blow.

272
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:49,520
Didn't we run out?

273
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,919
He went over all cocky.

274
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:52,920
Time's up.

275
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:03,880
It's up.

276
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,840
Now it's the Yellow Team's Hunt Time.

277
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,639
Whoever gets touched first.

278
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:18,120
Sun Mingyang is eliminated.

279
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:27,240
Yellow Team, send one up.

280
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,679
Alliance.

281
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:32,919
The three of us.

282
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:33,320
Sure.

283
00:13:33,321 --> 00:13:34,479
Blue, Orange, Green.

284
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:34,760
Okay.

285
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:35,640
Deal?

286
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,440
We don't take each other out first.

287
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:36,720
Sure.

288
00:13:36,721 --> 00:13:37,839
Take out everyone else first.

289
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,160
Sure,

290
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,160
because we've only got one player left.

291
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:39,520
Okay.

292
00:13:39,521 --> 00:13:41,039
The three of us make a perfect three-person team, deal?

293
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:41,480
Sure.

294
00:13:41,481 --> 00:13:43,640
Take out the balloon-pumper first.

295
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:48,800
I also found a bug.

296
00:13:48,801 --> 00:13:50,279
I can keep stepping on balloons for Hunt Time,

297
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,439
so we can keep catching people,

298
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:53,440
So that's how I kept extending my time.

299
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,000
They found a bug.

300
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:57,439
They could extend their time endlessly.

301
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,440
I figured it out.

302
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,039
One person finds a chance to pop balloons.

303
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:02,399
One person finds a chance to catch.

304
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,719
As soon as he saw me going to pop balloons,

305
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,560
he'd start catching.

306
00:14:04,561 --> 00:14:05,839
We were super in sync.

307
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,800
He's downstairs popping balloons.

308
00:14:06,801 --> 00:14:08,359
I was upstairs chasing people,

309
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,399
then I thought, no way.

310
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:10,639
I can't catch anyone on my own,

311
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:12,680
so I used a lot of little tricks.

312
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:15,559
Ready?

313
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:17,640
I was always at that fire escape.

314
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:20,480
At the fire escape,

315
00:14:20,481 --> 00:14:21,720
I caught Xiaomeng.

316
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:25,519
Then I came out of the bathroom,

317
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:26,920
and ran right into Senior.

318
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:31,760
Ziyu.

319
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:32,640
I tricked him too, saying,

320
00:14:32,641 --> 00:14:33,841
there were hunters behind him.

321
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,399
Run!

322
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:36,400
Someone's over there.

323
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:38,279
Run, someone's over there.

324
00:14:38,280 --> 00:14:39,280
Got him!

325
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,119
He got away.

326
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,160
Who's on the Pink Team?

327
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,080
Let me catch my breath.

328
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:06,240
Green Team's Hunt Time is over.

329
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,719
I feel like this isn't much fun anymore.

330
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,880
Let's go chase people down.

331
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:17,640
I'm done playing.

332
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:20,640
Over there.

333
00:15:20,641 --> 00:15:21,679
You go over there.

334
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:23,519
I'll block them on the second floor.

335
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:25,879
Zhou Guorui is coming up the emergency stairs.

336
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:26,920
Let's block them together.

337
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:29,559
Yellow Team's Hunt Time is over.

338
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:30,480
Forty seconds left.

339
00:15:30,481 --> 00:15:31,999
The countdown had already started,

340
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,439
so I panicked.

341
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:35,680
Anyway, I went all in burning my bridges.

342
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:44,919
Yellow Team, ten seconds until the game ends.

343
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:45,920
Hurry.

344
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:49,600
Wait, no.

345
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:54,839
Yellow Team, thirty seconds until the game ends.

346
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:57,200
He went downstairs.

347
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,400
No wait.

348
00:16:01,401 --> 00:16:02,759
How's he blowing it up so fast?

349
00:16:02,760 --> 00:16:03,640
Quick.

350
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:04,640
Step on it.

351
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,159
Step on it.

352
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:09,160
Step on it now!

353
00:16:09,161 --> 00:16:10,919
Catching me would've been just one reach away.

354
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:12,160
That's how close it was.

355
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,879
Quick.

356
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:17,079
Now it's the Yellow Team's Hunt Time.

357
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:18,000
Later I thought, forget it,

358
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:18,960
maybe I'll just give up,

359
00:16:18,961 --> 00:16:20,481
because I really couldn't run anymore.

360
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,880
Game over.

361
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:25,120
Surviving till the end is winning.

362
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,719
The winner takes all.

363
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,640
There was really nothing I could do.

364
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:33,400
So smart.

365
00:16:33,401 --> 00:16:35,279
He was really so smart back then.

366
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:37,759
But his athletic ability is really strong.

367
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,680
He caught so many people in one go.

368
00:16:38,681 --> 00:16:39,799
I really didn't expect that.

369
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:41,439
So amazing.

370
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:43,399
There's a real kind of chemistry between us.

371
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:43,920
In a lot of situations,

372
00:16:43,921 --> 00:16:45,720
we were both thinking the same thing,

373
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:48,439
so the final winners are Ma Weixian,

374
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,440
and Zhou Guorui.

375
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:52,080
Let's present our prize,

376
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:53,520
A big gift.

377
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,080
A suitcase.

378
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,600
So jealous.

379
00:16:58,840 --> 00:16:59,440
Nice, bro.

380
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,440
That's awesome.

381
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:01,800
Thank you everyone.

382
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:02,520
Great work, everyone.

383
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,520
You really worked hard.

384
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:07,200
Senior, is there anything you'd like to say to everyone?

385
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,199
I think,

386
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,999
there's no need to use words

387
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,439
to express too much to you all.

388
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:13,759
Since you've chosen this profession,

389
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,679
I believe you all truly love it.

390
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:18,399
Each of you has your own strengths.

391
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:20,079
In the future, in this industry,

392
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:23,839
you must learn to 'go down' a little.

393
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:24,640
Put your focus,

394
00:17:24,641 --> 00:17:25,839
put your thoughts,

395
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:29,679
put even your energy into understanding this world,

396
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:31,639
understanding this society,

397
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:33,799
understanding the relationships between people.

398
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:35,679
I also hope everyone gets better and better.

399
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,680
Keep going.

400
00:17:36,681 --> 00:17:38,280
Thank you, Senior.

401
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:41,760
Three, two, one.

402
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,719
Okay, thank you, teachers.

403
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:48,879
Thank you, Senior.

404
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:49,919
Thank you.

405
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:51,560
Great work, everyone.

406
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:13,479
Learn the sounds and tones, distinguish the four tones.

407
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:16,600
The four tones must be clearly distinguished.

408
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:17,760
Get ready to breathe in.

409
00:18:17,761 --> 00:18:18,879
Exhale and rise.

410
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:19,240
Begin.

411
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,040
One.

412
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:20,680
Everyone up.

413
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,680
One.

414
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,839
Five, six, seven.

415
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:31,840
Go.

416
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:35,440
Come with me.

417
00:18:35,441 --> 00:18:36,599
I'm not going.

418
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:37,639
Come with me.

419
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,640
Not going.

420
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:42,359
I'll stay with you till the end of time.

421
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:44,600
Forever.

422
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,479
Stand up straight.

423
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,480
Repeat.

424
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,240
Right.

425
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,240
Again.

426
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,080
Waiter.

427
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:57,080
Chicken feet and pork ribs rice.

428
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:58,080
No scallions.

429
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,279
Hold it.

430
00:18:59,280 --> 00:19:00,400
Hold it a bit longer.

431
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,520
Good.

432
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,280
It's getting richer and richer.

433
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,200
This part is good.

434
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,200
This part is fun.

435
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:11,560
Alright, class dismissed.

436
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:12,720
Thank you, teachers.

437
00:19:12,721 --> 00:19:14,161
Thanks for your hard work, teachers.

438
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,600
Stop spraying, it hurts like crazy.

439
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:41,800
Let me try one too.

440
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:43,760
Wait, don't move.

441
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:44,760
Okay.

442
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:51,840
What are you laughing at?

443
00:19:51,841 --> 00:19:53,001
Do you know what he just did?

444
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:55,919
I just wanted to see how you drew this.

445
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:56,920
Learn a trick or two.

446
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:58,080
You go first, show it.

447
00:19:58,520 --> 00:19:59,679
I'm already ready.

448
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:01,159
This one is mine.

449
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,160
My dear Guorui.

450
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:05,080
How is it?

451
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:06,599
It's hideous.

452
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:07,799
Time to show mine.

453
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:08,839
Looks good, right?

454
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:09,919
It's actually pretty good.

455
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:10,600
It's so vivid.

456
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:11,480
It really does.

457
00:20:11,481 --> 00:20:12,976
Bro, which one do you think looks better?

458
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,759
Look at this.

459
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:15,920
This is the one, right?

460
00:20:17,760 --> 00:20:18,920
Bro, pick again.

461
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,599
As a partner, the thing I value most

462
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:24,559
is instantly following up in a team fight.

463
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:26,079
I think we need to have chemistry.

464
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:27,279
And he and I,

465
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:28,439
really do have great chemistry.

466
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:30,199
I feel like he's

467
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:32,799
the most in-sync partner I've met so far.

468
00:20:32,800 --> 00:20:34,479
I feel like both of us

469
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:36,599
are kind of easygoing people,

470
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:37,440
pretty quirky.

471
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,040
When I first saw him,

472
00:20:38,041 --> 00:20:39,441
I thought he seemed pretty distant.

473
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:42,039
But after filming for a few days,

474
00:20:42,040 --> 00:20:42,760
I realized,

475
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:43,680
he is really quirky.

476
00:20:43,681 --> 00:20:45,039
I just want to explore

477
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:46,879
his inner world more,

478
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:50,399
especially the intellectual and spiritual aspects.

479
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,080
As for me,

480
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:52,000
I'm someone

481
00:20:52,001 --> 00:20:53,680
whose mindset is always changing.

482
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,679
Before high school,

483
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,399
I was always studying really hard.

484
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,479
My grades were excellent.

485
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:00,359
I was only 30 points short of a perfect score

486
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:01,679
on the high school entrance exam.

487
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:03,079
And then...

488
00:21:03,080 --> 00:21:03,520
So impressive!

489
00:21:03,521 --> 00:21:04,599
Then after starting high school,

490
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:06,439
because I couldn't quite keep up academically,

491
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,440
I switched to painting.

492
00:21:07,441 --> 00:21:08,839
Then in college,

493
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:10,879
I got involved with the drama club,

494
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:12,439
and some student film crews.

495
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,799
That's when I got

496
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:15,800
the idea of becoming an actor.

497
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:17,200
Now that I'm an actor,

498
00:21:17,201 --> 00:21:18,999
I might keep painting in the future,

499
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,439
but I'll keep trying new things.

500
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:21,839
I'll stay curious.

501
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:24,239
Actually, you have a really strong sense of security.

502
00:21:24,240 --> 00:21:26,719
I feel like I'm the opposite of you in that way.

503
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:29,519
Based on my experiences growing up,

504
00:21:29,520 --> 00:21:30,840
I'd say I've been pretty anxious,

505
00:21:31,560 --> 00:21:33,960
or my sense of security is basically zero.

506
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,719
Why did you take my guitar away?

507
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:48,280
Give it back.

508
00:21:48,281 --> 00:21:49,479
Let me play it a bit.

509
00:21:49,480 --> 00:21:50,000
You can't play.

510
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,000
You're gonna break my guitar.

511
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,000
No, how would I break it?

512
00:21:52,001 --> 00:21:53,559
How could this thing even break?

513
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:54,680
Then teach me how to play.

514
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:56,360
Sure.

515
00:21:57,040 --> 00:21:58,079
To play a C chord,

516
00:21:58,080 --> 00:21:59,319
here, this finger of yours,

517
00:21:59,320 --> 00:22:00,359
place it here.

518
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:01,120
This one.

519
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:01,760
Press it down, right?

520
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:02,600
Yes, press it down.

521
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:03,520
It hurts.

522
00:22:03,521 --> 00:22:05,079
Hurting is right.

523
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:06,159
That meansl'm doing it right. Right?

524
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,239
Yes.

525
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:08,439
Pressing down tight. Don't slack off.

526
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:08,880
Come on.

527
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:09,480
No, I...

528
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,000
This...

529
00:22:10,001 --> 00:22:11,439
I've never suffered like this in my whole life.

530
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:12,879
Well done, young master.

531
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,319
You've never suffered like this, huh?

532
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:15,880
Why are you being so dramatic?

533
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:17,440
Try it again.

534
00:22:17,441 --> 00:22:18,520
No, press it down firmly.

535
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:19,360
Yes.

536
00:22:19,361 --> 00:22:20,799
Press it further in.

537
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:21,879
Further in.

538
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:22,720
It's not going further in.

539
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:23,240
More.

540
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:24,240
I'm pressing it into my flesh!

541
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:25,240
Yes, keep going.

542
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:31,799
How is this any different from torturing me?

543
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:32,480
Look at you.

544
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:33,480
That's it.

545
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:35,400
Awesome.

546
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:36,520
Like this.

547
00:22:36,521 --> 00:22:37,559
Just keep the beat for me, okay?

548
00:22:37,560 --> 00:22:38,880
Can I do a freestyle rap?

549
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,520
Sure.

550
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:43,120
Now you go.

551
00:22:43,120 --> 00:22:44,120
Think of a topic.

552
00:22:44,120 --> 00:22:44,880
Sun Mingyang.

553
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:45,880
OK.

554
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:46,880
Come on.

555
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,679
I'll never forget,

556
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:50,560
that moment when you said,

557
00:22:50,561 --> 00:22:53,119
you were standing next to option C.

558
00:22:53,120 --> 00:22:54,320
I couldn't protest,

559
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:57,399
so I knew I had to pick you.

560
00:22:57,400 --> 00:23:00,719
At the time I was really sad too,

561
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:03,119
and thinking about it kept me up at night.

562
00:23:03,120 --> 00:23:05,879
So right now I can't sit here with you,

563
00:23:05,880 --> 00:23:07,279
that's why I have to stand.

564
00:23:07,280 --> 00:23:08,560
What should I do?

565
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:12,120
What do you mean you couldn't choose?

566
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,919
I didn't have a clear preference between them,

567
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:18,359
so I told you two to just do rock-paper-scissors.

568
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:19,720
Rock, paper, scissors.

569
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,319
So I won rock-paper-scissors, right?

570
00:23:22,320 --> 00:23:23,959
Yeah, I'd rather leave it to fate.

571
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,560
And then we became partners.

572
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:28,679
I never thought I'd open up this fast,

573
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:29,480
